# Cardcom checkout

This is not a React checkout. Cardcom hosts the Low Profile page and supplies Knockout, wallets, validation, and payment.

## Where to edit

- **`templates/cardcom/redirect-normal/`** — full-page redirect (Hebrew / English). Paste into Cardcom when checkout is the whole window.
- **`templates/cardcom/iframe-normal/`** — compact iframe-only (Hebrew / English). Paste into Cardcom when checkout sits in a shop iframe.
- `cardcom-preview/` — localhost visual sandbox. Mock labels and stand-in wallet assets. Never paste this folder. `html.checkout-embed` is preview-only.
- **`cardcom-preview/mock.js` is frozen.** Do not edit it.

The React app (`cardcom-tester/`) is a shell: three sections (redirect page, iframe-only, either). Do not touch the iframe DOM.

## Production constraints

- Do not add JavaScript to paste files.
- Do not rewrite `data-bind` attributes or rename Cardcom IDs.
- Do not use `embed`, `object`, `frameset`, `frame`, `iframe`, `meta`, `link`, or `style` elements in production HTML.
- Do not hide both `#txtCardOwnerPhone` and `#txtCardOwnerEmail` (3DS).
- Do not `display:none` live wallet injection stubs (`#ApplePayDivContainer`, `#BitDivContainer`, `#GooglePayDiv`) unless empty.
- Wallet availability is terminal + Knockout, not CSS.
- Footer wording comes from Cardcom labels. Do not replace it.

## Submit

`cardcom_export` (or `cardcom_html` then `cardcom_css`). Do not F5 Cardcom's preview window.
